<title>HUNGARY: Hungary Jan-July 96 C/A deficit $967 mln.</title>
<headline>Hungary Jan-July 96 C/A deficit $967 mln.</headline>
<dateline>BUDAPEST 1996-09-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Hungary's current account deficit in the January-July period of 1996 was $967 million, down from $2,047 million in the same period of 1995,the National Bank of Hungary said in a statement on Monday.  </p>
<p>The current account deficit widened to $33 million in July from zero in July 1995, the central bank said. HUNGARY C/A BALANCE (in million dollars)</p>
<p>    JULY 96     JUNE 96     JAN-JULY 96	 JAN-JULY 95</p>
<p>     -33	   -196	   -967		  -2,047</p>
<p>-- Budapest newsroom (36 1) 327-4040</p>
